    "detailed_description": "A fast-paced 2D fighting game with a colorful, retro feel. Inspired by the <strong>90's classic Kombat-style</strong> of games that use the digital pad: 5 buttons (<i>two for punches, two for kicks and one for blocking</i>) and a basic move set for all characters with up to 4 unique special moves each.<br><br><strong>Features</strong>:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><u>Online mode</u>: fight other players with insta rematches (<i>with rollback netcode</i>)<br></li><li><u>Arcade mode</u>: face the AI for warmups or just for fun<br></li><li><u>Versus mode</u>: local 2P matches<br></li><li><u>Training mode</u>: viewable hitboxes and dummy recording<br></li><li>6 characters/stages<br></li><li>FM synth soundtrack and sound effects<br></li><li>Timeless pixel art</li></ul>",
